    "Implement Strict Negative Constraints within the system prompt: Never quote exact surgical prices beyond standard consultation fee ranges; never give medical or legal diagnosis; always collect the user's full name, phone number, and email address before confirming an appointment booking; if a user expresses extreme frustration, smoothly escalate the conversation to human staff.",
